RPi ISM — licensing
Copyright (c) RF Sparkling Kft.

This repository uses two licenses. The full texts are in the LICENSES/
directory.

1. Hardware — CERN-OHL-S-2.0
   SPDX-License-Identifier: CERN-OHL-S-2.0
   Applies to the hardware design sources and their exports: schematics,
   PCB layouts, libraries, fabrication outputs (Gerber, drill, BOM, CPL),
   3D models and mechanical files, and the hardware documentation
   (everything under CAD/ and hardware/ unless a file states otherwise).
   Full text: LICENSES/CERN-OHL-S-2.0.txt

2. Software and firmware — Apache-2.0
   SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
   Applies to all source code: drivers, libraries, firmware, tools and
   scripts (everything under software/, firmware/ and tools/ unless a file
   states otherwise).
   Full text: LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt

Files carrying their own license header (for example third-party code under
the Zlib license) remain under that license.

Earlier revisions of this repository were published under the GNU GPL v3.
Those revisions remain available under the GPL v3.
